<title>FRANCE: TENNIS-FRANCE LEAD BELGIUM IN FED CUP.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-FRANCE LEAD BELGIUM IN FED CUP.</headline>
<dateline>NICE, France 1997-07-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>France led Belgium 1-0 after the opening single of their women's tennis Federation Cup semifinal on Saturday.</p>
<p>Alexandra Fusai (France) beat Sabine Appelmans (Belgium)6-7 (2-7) 6-3 6-1</p>
